</div>

<div class="tab-content" id="tab-docs">
  <div class="section">
    <h2>How AI Tools HQ Works</h2>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>The Big Picture</h3>
      <p>AI Tools HQ is a directory website listing AI tools with reviews, comparisons, and affiliate links. Here's how the pieces fit together:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Database (Supabase)</strong> stores all tool data: names, descriptions, reviews, affiliate links, categories</li>
        <li><strong>Website (Astro + Vercel)</strong> builds static HTML pages from the database at deploy time</li>
        <li><strong>Automation (n8n Cloud)</strong> runs daily tasks: generating reviews, posting to social media, creating SEO content</li>
        <li><strong>Local Scripts (ai-tools-hq-local)</strong> are backup tools for manual/batch operations</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>How a New Tool Gets Added</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Add tool to Supabase <code>tools</code> table (name, slug, category, website, pricing)</li>
        <li>Set <code>generated = false</code> so the review generator picks it up</li>
        <li>n8n "Generate Reviews" workflow runs daily at 9 AM and writes the review</li>
        <li>Push any code change to GitHub master branch (or trigger Vercel rebuild manually)</li>
        <li>Vercel rebuilds the site, pulling fresh data from Supabase</li>
        <li>New tool page appears on ai-tools-hq.com</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>How Affiliate Links Work</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Sign up for the affiliate program (URLs are in the Affiliates tab and in <code>update-affiliate-links.js</code>)</li>
        <li>Get your tracking link from the affiliate dashboard</li>
        <li>Open <code>ai-tools-hq-local/update-affiliate-links.js</code></li>
        <li>Uncomment the tool's line and replace <code>PENDING</code> with your tracking URL</li>
        <li>Run: <code>cd ai-tools-hq-local &amp;&amp; node update-affiliate-links.js</code></li>
        <li>The script updates Supabase directly. Next site rebuild will show the affiliate link.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>How the Site Gets Rebuilt</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Automatic:</strong> Any push to the <code>master</code> branch on GitHub triggers a Vercel deploy</li>
        <li><strong>Manual:</strong> Go to Vercel dashboard &gt; Deployments &gt; "Redeploy"</li>
        <li><strong>Future:</strong> n8n "Vercel Auto Rebuild" workflow (needs deploy hook URL from Vercel)</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>Important:</strong> The site is static (SSG). Database changes don't appear until the next rebuild.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>Where Things Live</h3>
      <table>
        <tr><td><strong>Website code</strong></td><td>toolscout-business/site/</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Local scripts</strong></td><td>ai-tools-hq-local/</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Database</strong></td><td>Supabase (ebhtzgimevacvcgiyesc)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Hosting</strong></td><td>Vercel (auto-deploys from GitHub master)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Automation</strong></td><td>n8n Cloud (mslugga35.app.n8n.cloud)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Git repo</strong></td><td>github.com/mslugga35/ai-tools-hq</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>Common Tasks</h3>
      <table>
        <tr><td><strong>Add a new tool</strong></td><td>Insert into Supabase tools table with <code>generated=false</code>. Review auto-generates next day.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Add affiliate link</strong></td><td>Edit <code>update-affiliate-links.js</code>, run it. Rebuild site.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Rebuild site</strong></td><td>Push to GitHub master or click "Redeploy" in Vercel dashboard.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Generate reviews now</strong></td><td>Run <code>cd ai-tools-hq-local &amp;&amp; node generate-reviews.js</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Check tool status</strong></td><td>Open this dashboard or run <code>node check-status.js</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Check n8n</strong></td><td>Visit mslugga35.app.n8n.cloud and check execution history</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>Two Keys, Two Roles</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Anon Key</strong> (public, safe to expose): Can only read tools where <code>generated = true</code>. Used by the public website and this dashboard.</li>
        <li><strong>Service Key</strong> (private, never expose): Can read/write everything. Used by admin scripts and n8n workflows.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-section">
      <h3>Revenue Model</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Visitors land on tool pages from Google search</li>
        <li>They click affiliate links to sign up for tools</li>
        <li>You earn commissions (15-50% depending on program)</li>
        <li>More tools + more reviews + better SEO = more traffic = more revenue</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="tab-content" id="tab-checklist">
